WEBVTT

00:04.310 --> 00:09.940
I have always believed

00:10.070 --> 00:14.450
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:10.070 --> 00:14.450
owaranai yume wo nigiri shimete

00:10.070 --> 00:14.450
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.450 --> 00:17.740
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.460 --> 00:31.380
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.460 --> 00:31.380
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.460 --> 00:31.380
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.380 --> 00:34.090
空回りするけど

00:31.380 --> 00:34.090
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.380 --> 00:34.090
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:34.550 --> 00:37.760
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:34.550 --> 00:37.760
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:34.550 --> 00:37.760
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:37.890 --> 00:41.480
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:37.890 --> 00:41.480
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:37.890 --> 00:41.480
You should be yourself.

00:41.600 --> 00:47.320
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:41.600 --> 00:47.320
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:41.600 --> 00:47.320
But you know, a messed up scenario

00:48.980 --> 00:54.490
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:48.980 --> 00:54.490
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:48.980 --> 00:54.490
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:54.490 --> 00:55.990
TRUST MY WAY

00:56.030 --> 01:01.450
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:56.030 --> 01:01.450
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:56.030 --> 01:01.450
The wind, it caresses my cheek.

01:01.710 --> 01:05.130
風と-緒に心地好く

01:01.710 --> 01:05.130
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:01.710 --> 01:05.130
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.130 --> 01:10.010
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.130 --> 01:10.010
tanoshimeru sokudo de to ne kara mo

01:05.130 --> 01:10.010
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.130 --> 01:15.640
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.130 --> 01:15.640
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.130 --> 01:15.640
these feelings won't ever change.

01:15.890 --> 01:20.220
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:15.890 --> 01:20.220
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:15.890 --> 01:20.220
I"m taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.220 --> 01:23.850
TRUST ME MY WAY

01:36.140 --> 01:37.730
This is quite an...

01:44.850 --> 01:48.090
... unexpected turn of events.

01:48.970 --> 01:53.960
Izumi is Izumi, But Izumi Will No Longer Yield to Anyone

01:55.020 --> 01:57.090
It sure is hot here!

01:57.340 --> 01:58.600
Just as you would expect from the southern islands!

01:59.140 --> 02:00.890
Let's take a lot of good pictures, okay?

02:02.340 --> 02:02.970
Yeah...

02:03.250 --> 02:05.100
Izumi-sama!

02:05.230 --> 02:06.540
Mitsuki-sama!

02:08.350 --> 02:11.280
Now then, the photo shoot will begin in an hour.

02:16.990 --> 02:17.660
Huh?

02:17.810 --> 02:19.960
My, my, my! Pochi's just hopeless.

02:20.210 --> 02:23.870
He built up a lot of stress from being cooped up so long.

02:24.610 --> 02:27.390
Now, first we have the swimsuit photo shoot, Onee-chan!

02:27.660 --> 02:28.700
Y-Yeah...

02:41.880 --> 02:43.150
She's so stiff...

02:43.260 --> 02:44.550
Onee-chan, relax!

02:44.930 --> 02:45.680
Right.

02:45.930 --> 02:47.590
I'm trying to, but...

02:48.640 --> 02:50.060
I'm sorry, everyone.

02:50.520 --> 02:52.040
After you came here with me...

02:53.140 --> 02:57.200
By the way, why is everyone from Mitsuki's Bodyguard Squad here?

02:57.560 --> 03:00.670
Well, the fees for a professional would be expensive, wouldn't they?

03:00.970 --> 03:03.110
You say that, but...

03:03.610 --> 03:06.460
You don't have a choice. We're doing it because it's an order from Mitsuki-chan!

03:06.950 --> 03:08.210
Be grateful to her!

03:08.600 --> 03:11.130
Don't take any weird pictures like Yoshitaka would!

03:11.690 --> 03:13.580
Don't compare me with a guy like him!

03:15.310 --> 03:16.900
<i>As if Izumi would be the one I want!</i>

03:17.230 --> 03:20.300
<i>If I'd take any, they'd be of Mitsuki... and while we're alone together, too!</i>

03:21.620 --> 03:22.720
Yo, Izumi!

03:23.010 --> 03:23.860
Is it going well?

03:24.070 --> 03:25.100
I guess not.

03:25.140 --> 03:26.050
Yeah, it looks that way.

03:27.200 --> 03:28.180
Yoshitaka!

03:28.270 --> 03:28.840
Why are you...

03:29.030 --> 03:31.060
I found Izumi-san!

03:33.670 --> 03:35.400
A-Anna-chan, too?

03:35.680 --> 03:37.360
We came after you!

03:37.600 --> 03:40.750
I'll tell you this right now... I'm only here for the resort.

03:40.970 --> 03:44.230
You say that, but you came here to interfere, didn't you?

03:45.360 --> 03:47.010
I see no need to do that.

03:47.260 --> 03:52.440
The people who want photobooks of you are all just narrow-minded fetishists anyway!

03:52.600 --> 03:53.480
<i>You're </i>one to talk!

03:53.930 --> 03:58.680
Besides, nothing good is going to come out from the hands of a guy without a shred of passion!

03:59.700 --> 04:01.770
<i>That hurts, but it's true!</i>

04:02.390 --> 04:04.510
IZUMI!

04:04.640 --> 04:06.430
STOP THAT THIS INSTANT!

04:06.470 --> 04:08.170
YOUR FATHER DOESN'T APPROVE!

04:08.560 --> 04:09.370
DAD?!

04:09.470 --> 04:10.440
IZUMI!

04:10.640 --> 04:11.160
RUN AWAY WITH...

04:11.640 --> 04:12.740
ME!

04:19.320 --> 04:20.280
Mom?!

04:20.860 --> 04:21.780
Karin?

04:21.940 --> 04:23.260
Izumi-oneechan!

04:24.110 --> 04:29.640
Karin, we're going to keep an eye on Dad so he doesn't get in the way of your sister's work.

04:29.990 --> 04:30.500
Yeah!

04:31.240 --> 04:32.290
See you later, Izumi!

04:32.670 --> 04:33.360
You too, Anna-chan!

04:33.360 --> 04:34.450
A-All right...

04:34.450 --> 04:35.660
Yes, Mother!

04:38.000 --> 04:39.990
Onee-chan, do your best!

04:43.350 --> 04:46.670
But, even though I came all the way to the southern islands,

04:46.880 --> 04:49.430
the faces are ultimately all the same.

04:49.600 --> 04:50.260
Rather, they came.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.760
Take that!

04:55.870 --> 04:57.720
All right, take <i>that</i>!

05:00.680 --> 05:01.710
Boing, boing!

05:01.710 --> 05:02.860
What the...

05:06.430 --> 05:09.030
Really... This is the only way to enjoy the southern islands!

05:25.180 --> 05:26.900
"What a beauty!"

05:28.540 --> 05:30.590
"You won't win me that easily!"

05:30.960 --> 05:32.840
Ah, Pochi just spoke!

05:34.210 --> 05:35.240
That was me!

05:35.690 --> 05:37.940
There's no way Pochi could talk!

05:38.260 --> 05:39.330
He's an <i>alligator!</i>

05:39.630 --> 05:41.210
I-I guess you're right.

05:42.730 --> 05:45.620
But his mood really isn't normal.

05:50.290 --> 05:51.280
He got rejected!

05:51.830 --> 05:52.750
Oh, dear...

05:53.300 --> 05:54.440
Ellen!

06:02.840 --> 06:04.390
Oh, are these your friends?

06:08.120 --> 06:10.220
What was that sensation just now?

06:11.080 --> 06:12.850
A blonde! All right!

06:13.310 --> 06:14.810
An adventure at a resort...

06:15.380 --> 06:17.590
There's no such thing as shame when you travel!

06:20.640 --> 06:21.400
Hey, Pochi!

06:22.810 --> 06:24.900
Are you going to give up just because of something like that?

06:25.230 --> 06:27.110
So what if you fail once or twice?!

06:27.870 --> 06:29.980
You should attack as many times as you need to!

06:31.140 --> 06:33.050
You're plotting something, aren't you?

06:33.490 --> 06:34.720
Don't be ridiculous!

06:35.220 --> 06:37.170
I'm simply supporting Pochi!

06:37.830 --> 06:40.800
Don't you feel anything when you see Pochi like this?!

06:41.400 --> 06:41.710
Oh?

06:42.210 --> 06:43.560
He <i>does</i> have a nice side to him!

06:44.260 --> 06:44.760
Listen up.

06:45.260 --> 06:47.140
Women are weak against overbearing men!

06:47.350 --> 06:50.630
She was just testing you with that attitude earlier!

06:51.010 --> 06:51.640
Got it?

06:51.760 --> 06:52.710
She expects good things of you!

06:54.450 --> 06:59.370
When you go in there again, she'll act like she doesn't like it. But make no mistake... She's putting on a show!

06:59.530 --> 07:02.230
No matter how much she seems to hate it or how far you have to go,

07:02.440 --> 07:05.600
hang on to her persistently, shadow her, follow her everywhere!

07:06.270 --> 07:07.340
Hey, hold it!

07:07.550 --> 07:07.900
All right!

07:07.930 --> 07:08.310
Go!

07:11.480 --> 07:13.370
What are you thinking?!

07:13.700 --> 07:16.290
Isn't that the same as being a stalker?!

07:16.530 --> 07:17.740
Oh, is that right?

07:18.150 --> 07:21.290
I thought I was giving him some good advice...

07:28.250 --> 07:29.510
Oh, I'm sorry.

07:29.880 --> 07:31.970
My stupid alligator is bugging you.

07:33.490 --> 07:35.810
He's completely unrefined. How embarrassing.

07:37.000 --> 07:40.620
He's a moron, a lowlife, greedy, and perverted.

07:41.060 --> 07:43.520
Honestly, he's beyond repair.

07:44.130 --> 07:46.440
Well, can I treat you to a meal or something to make it up to you?

07:48.190 --> 07:50.020
My, what a wonderful person!

07:50.370 --> 07:52.530
That's... what... you...

07:52.530 --> 07:54.810
WERE AFTER, HUH?!

07:55.510 --> 07:57.600
Seriously... I can't believe you went out of your way to do that!

07:57.980 --> 08:00.360
You're just like your old man!

08:01.760 --> 08:02.990
Don't get in the way, Izumi!

08:03.670 --> 08:05.170
Infidelity is a man's nature!

08:05.500 --> 08:06.030
Forgive me!

08:08.740 --> 08:11.380
I keep telling you I'm not your wife!

08:11.520 --> 08:13.010
You enemy of women!

08:13.850 --> 08:17.840
Do you really think you can win against me as I am today?

08:18.510 --> 08:19.730
Men prefer...

08:20.350 --> 08:22.030
BLONDES!

08:24.570 --> 08:26.250
I don't care!

08:28.450 --> 08:31.130
Did you really think you could win against me?

08:31.410 --> 08:32.840
I wonder...

08:36.320 --> 08:38.660
This is the cliché pattern for summer love comedies!

08:39.470 --> 08:41.280
How dare you...

08:42.480 --> 08:44.330
Izumi-saaan!

08:47.160 --> 08:48.830
Let go of me, Anna-chan!

08:50.130 --> 08:50.380
Hey!

08:50.840 --> 08:51.800
Hold it, Yoshitaka!

08:52.090 --> 08:52.750
Sorry to have kept you wai-

09:02.560 --> 09:03.310
All right!

09:05.820 --> 09:08.070
"Please accept my feelings."

09:09.430 --> 09:12.220
"I wonder if you have what it takes to go out with me.

09:12.710 --> 09:16.340
A pet must be loyal to its owner.

09:17.350 --> 09:21.300
If you can cast aside everything and become something of use to your master,

09:21.560 --> 09:22.910
then I'll think about it."

09:25.060 --> 09:25.760
That's what they said.

09:26.340 --> 09:27.750
"That's what they said," huh?

09:28.420 --> 09:29.860
That was your imagination.

09:30.220 --> 09:31.990
But it looks like I'm right.

09:33.320 --> 09:34.120
What do you want?

09:40.960 --> 09:43.000
This is the pose of submission!

09:43.700 --> 09:46.140
Pochi... you're serous, aren't you?

09:46.640 --> 09:48.480
Yes, yes.

09:48.780 --> 09:51.660
If that's how it is, then I'm sure you'll show your affection.

09:52.240 --> 09:53.980
Crawl around on all fours and be thankful you're able to do so!

09:54.090 --> 09:55.640
What a deviant, just as always!

09:56.150 --> 09:59.130
Pochi-kun, please get along with her, all right?

09:59.330 --> 10:02.260
Now, will you take me up on that dinner offer so we can get to know each other?

10:02.440 --> 10:03.540
Yes, gladly.

10:03.730 --> 10:05.160
I did it!

10:05.490 --> 10:07.210
Well, let's go!

10:11.510 --> 10:14.440
Now then, I'll formally introduce myself.

10:14.940 --> 10:15.800
I'm Alicia.

10:16.510 --> 10:17.590
I came here from France.

10:18.330 --> 10:20.060
That girl is my pet, Ellen.

10:20.500 --> 10:23.300
My hobbies are cooking and sewing.

10:23.580 --> 10:24.020
Huh?

10:26.830 --> 10:29.930
I'm glad that Pochi and Ellen can get along so well.

10:30.140 --> 10:32.430
Are you going to take her home and make her your wife?

10:36.510 --> 10:37.490
Damn you, Pochi!

10:37.610 --> 10:39.320
Things are going so freaking well for him!

10:39.850 --> 10:41.650
And I've still got a long ways to go!

10:42.410 --> 10:44.450
I've got to make some progress or else...

10:45.000 --> 10:46.790
STOP IT, IZUMI!

10:47.990 --> 10:49.050
Dad?!

10:49.220 --> 10:49.880
Izumi!

10:50.340 --> 10:52.360
The world of show business is a frightening place!

10:59.780 --> 11:00.650
Onee-chan!

11:01.790 --> 11:03.350
Now, let's get going, honey!

11:03.430 --> 11:04.950
Dad looks like he's having a hard time breathing.

11:05.160 --> 11:06.060
He's fine.

11:06.480 --> 11:08.610
That's what happens when he does something so off the wall!

11:09.370 --> 11:10.720
You're incredible, Dad!

11:14.070 --> 11:15.150
This is bad.

11:15.570 --> 11:17.140
Karin's going to be deeply influenced by this!

11:17.320 --> 11:18.490
Honestly.

11:18.570 --> 11:19.650
What's with that father?

11:20.530 --> 11:24.350
I mean, I'd be more than satisfied with being alone with Karin and your mother.

11:24.590 --> 11:26.260
You really don't care if you die, do you?

11:26.580 --> 11:27.940
Yoshitaka-kun, Pochi-kun?

11:28.150 --> 11:28.790
Yes?

11:29.070 --> 11:32.380
Would you like to come stay over at my villa tonight?

11:32.760 --> 11:34.300
... come stay over?

11:34.840 --> 11:36.510
... come stay over?

11:37.050 --> 11:38.050
...stay over?

11:38.720 --> 11:40.900
WHAAAT?!

12:04.530 --> 12:05.660
Jeez...

12:06.490 --> 12:09.040
What is Alicia thinking?

12:10.950 --> 12:12.000
Onee-chan...

12:12.330 --> 12:14.720
That's certainly a natural facial expression, but...

12:14.950 --> 12:16.060
Ah, I'm sorry!

12:16.350 --> 12:18.440
Are you worried about Master?

12:18.620 --> 12:19.760
Of course not!

12:20.180 --> 12:21.790
The one I'm worried about is<i> Alicia!</i>

12:22.040 --> 12:25.560
Would you like to come stay over at my villa tonight?

12:25.800 --> 12:27.100
I-I'll go. I'll go!

12:27.220 --> 12:28.580
Wh-What are you saying?!

12:28.850 --> 12:30.430
Alicia, what are you planning?

12:32.620 --> 12:33.650
In that case...

12:34.440 --> 12:36.410
Izumi-san, would you like to come along?

12:56.090 --> 12:57.300
What do you want?

12:57.670 --> 12:59.030
I don't remember calling for you.

13:00.080 --> 13:01.260
Are you going to go no matter what?

13:02.070 --> 13:03.900
I don't think you should.

13:04.940 --> 13:07.230
I have a strange feeling about that girl.

13:07.470 --> 13:08.140
What's this?

13:08.180 --> 13:09.980
Don't tell me you're jealous!

13:12.020 --> 13:13.400
Of course not!

13:13.980 --> 13:16.740
At any rate, you're not taking one step out of this room!

13:18.650 --> 13:19.270
Pochi!

13:20.390 --> 13:21.210
All right, let's go!

13:24.700 --> 13:25.990
You won't get away! Anna-chan!

13:26.140 --> 13:26.620
Right!

13:32.700 --> 13:33.540
We did it!

13:36.310 --> 13:38.690
I'm glad I keep this cleaver around for self defense!

13:39.850 --> 13:40.840
No way!

13:43.770 --> 13:45.430
All right! We're going to get through!

13:49.540 --> 13:50.850
You fell into our trap!

13:51.060 --> 13:52.690
Mitsuki set that one up!

13:57.950 --> 13:58.980
Thanks for the assist, Pochi!

13:59.280 --> 14:00.050
Hey!

14:00.810 --> 14:02.390
Wait!

14:03.420 --> 14:06.440
Pochi and Master are invincible today!

14:09.070 --> 14:09.770
There it is!

14:11.720 --> 14:12.750
Alicia-san!

14:13.500 --> 14:14.460
Sorry to keep you waiting!

14:15.370 --> 14:17.090
Some weird stalker was trailing us,

14:17.530 --> 14:20.370
but we soon took care of her!

14:19.510 --> 14:20.050
What was that?!

14:20.460 --> 14:22.260
What are you two talking ab-

14:29.150 --> 14:29.830
A scream?

14:42.640 --> 14:44.900
I'm going to remember this!

14:45.240 --> 14:45.980
When I get home...

14:46.140 --> 14:47.060
Shut up!

14:48.650 --> 14:51.530
Come on now... Call me Master!

14:52.980 --> 14:55.090
M-M-Master!

14:55.330 --> 14:58.210
FACTION

14:55.330 --> 14:58.210
SATIS

15:02.030 --> 15:03.940
Just as I thought... You have that quality in you.

15:04.730 --> 15:05.580
Alicia?

15:05.950 --> 15:07.570
I knew it from the beginning.

15:07.860 --> 15:10.030
You're the same kind of person that I am.

15:11.560 --> 15:17.130
It's much more worthwhile to discipline a feisty one like him than a man who's docile to begin with.

15:17.220 --> 15:18.280
Yeah, that's true!

15:18.470 --> 15:19.850
Taste my daily resentment!

15:24.750 --> 15:25.660
Onee-chan...

15:27.470 --> 15:28.070
Mitsuki?

15:28.450 --> 15:29.170
Anna-chan?

15:29.760 --> 15:30.840
Mitsuki-chan, help m-

15:32.350 --> 15:33.240
Silence!

15:34.300 --> 15:35.770
That looks kind of fun!

15:35.990 --> 15:39.090
Izumi-san, I want you to discipline me too!

15:41.160 --> 15:42.890
Take this! And that!

15:46.010 --> 15:48.270
Thank you very much, Alicia-san!

15:49.190 --> 15:53.480
I was worried that Onee-chan wasn't very happy to be here.

15:53.480 --> 15:54.350
How about this?!

15:55.580 --> 15:57.450
Welcome to hell, you bastard!

15:58.250 --> 15:59.760
She looks just fine now.

16:00.390 --> 16:03.610
Yeah. I won't back down from anyone anymore!

16:03.780 --> 16:05.390
That's the spirit, Onee-chan!

16:05.840 --> 16:08.670
I'm sure your debut event will go well now!

16:10.610 --> 16:11.530
Event?

16:12.100 --> 16:12.910
Huh?

16:13.160 --> 16:14.350
Didn't I tell you?

16:14.350 --> 16:22.170
Izumi-chan!

16:22.170 --> 16:23.170
Not yet?

16:23.290 --> 16:24.720
Izumi-chan!

16:24.750 --> 16:25.530
Hurry up!

16:25.530 --> 16:26.610
No way...

16:26.610 --> 16:27.710
Izumi-chan!

16:28.280 --> 16:29.470
It's incredible, isn't it?

16:29.720 --> 16:30.950
A huge turnout!

16:31.200 --> 16:32.840
It's a bunch of curious morons.

16:33.650 --> 16:37.630
I can't believe so many people would shamelessly come to see Izumi.

16:39.250 --> 16:40.760
Don't talk like that!

16:41.120 --> 16:44.050
There people are my precious patrons!

16:45.720 --> 16:49.170
They're people who went out of their way in order to come here and cheer me on!

16:49.330 --> 16:52.280
They're all on my side, unlike you!

16:53.370 --> 16:54.330
I won't let you.

16:54.700 --> 16:55.560
Huh?

16:55.560 --> 16:57.120
You're my maid!

16:57.870 --> 16:59.770
A maid needs only <i>one</i> master!

17:00.490 --> 17:01.200
Understand?

17:02.140 --> 17:04.530
I'm the only patron you need!

17:04.880 --> 17:06.590
What you're saying is unreasonable...

17:06.900 --> 17:09.140
This is no laughing matter. I've worked so hard to get this far!

17:09.300 --> 17:10.460
That's right, Izumi-san!

17:10.610 --> 17:11.420
It is, isn't it?

17:11.630 --> 17:12.950
Tell him, Anna-chan!

17:13.100 --> 17:16.570
I can't let you become the object of desire for a bunch of men, Izumi-san!

17:16.910 --> 17:19.230
Wh-What are you talking about, Anna-chan?

17:21.060 --> 17:23.490
Izumi-san is mine alone!

17:23.560 --> 17:28.200
Izumi is her father's Izumiii!

17:34.920 --> 17:36.920
Pochi, open your eyes!

17:37.450 --> 17:40.640
At this rate, there will be more and more people like her old man!

17:41.060 --> 17:42.400
You can't allow that, can you?

17:46.090 --> 17:47.520
That's how it is, Izumi!

17:48.060 --> 17:48.600
Huh?

17:48.920 --> 17:50.430
Where did Izumi-san go?

17:51.260 --> 17:52.180
There she is!

17:53.890 --> 17:56.910
This is my long-awaited chance... Don't get in my way!

17:57.000 --> 17:57.720
Izumi!

18:05.830 --> 18:08.180
My outfit!

18:10.830 --> 18:11.790
Where'd you go, Izumi?

18:12.330 --> 18:12.940
Unbelievable!

18:13.400 --> 18:14.200
Unbelievable!

18:14.530 --> 18:15.200
My head!

18:15.660 --> 18:16.300
Go!

18:17.120 --> 18:19.370
Refuse to give up!

18:21.800 --> 18:23.390
Wow!

18:24.340 --> 18:26.150
Why are you doing this?

18:31.950 --> 18:33.420
Please don't struggle.

18:34.010 --> 18:36.150
I don't want this to get violent.

18:36.330 --> 18:36.680
No!

18:37.140 --> 18:37.990
What are you doing?

18:38.210 --> 18:39.720
Stop it, Anna-chan!

18:40.200 --> 18:41.640
You should stay still!

18:42.520 --> 18:44.820
It looks like we're doing something indecent like this!

18:45.300 --> 18:47.360
That's fine with me every now and then, but...

18:48.540 --> 18:50.450
Izumi-san!

18:51.210 --> 18:52.230
What's with all of them?

18:52.480 --> 18:53.990
Cut it out already!

18:55.260 --> 18:56.150
Izumi-san!

18:58.240 --> 19:00.450
Izumi-san!

18:59.630 --> 19:00.450
Mom!

19:02.490 --> 19:03.030
Izumi-san!

19:03.030 --> 19:04.470
Is it okay to leave them alone?

19:05.140 --> 19:07.090
Onee-chan will be fine.

19:07.720 --> 19:09.420
I believe in her.

19:12.670 --> 19:13.990
Wait, Izumi!

19:14.770 --> 19:16.020
After her!

19:16.250 --> 19:17.130
Which way?

19:25.030 --> 19:26.020
I told you, didn't I?

19:26.480 --> 19:28.790
You can't become an idol.

19:28.880 --> 19:31.640
Izumi-san, stay as my Izumi-san alone!

19:31.790 --> 19:33.300
You're your father's Izumi.

19:35.110 --> 19:36.280
I can't believe this is the end.

19:36.650 --> 19:37.700
No way!

19:37.860 --> 19:38.830
God!

19:45.100 --> 19:46.770
Don't give up, Izumi-san.

19:54.120 --> 19:56.950
You should have realized something by now.

19:58.880 --> 20:00.060
Am I wrong?

20:03.010 --> 20:04.460
Not that again!

20:04.850 --> 20:06.320
It's show time!

20:16.020 --> 20:18.540
Your future is on the other side of that light.

20:19.030 --> 20:21.020
You can do it. I'm certain of it.

20:23.570 --> 20:26.760
I can... go there?

20:33.070 --> 20:33.880
You're not going anywhere!

20:37.120 --> 20:39.260
I'm not going to be at your beck and call anymore!

20:39.720 --> 20:40.560
Damn it!

20:42.480 --> 20:43.970
I'm going to rise above this!

20:44.430 --> 20:45.760
Above the life I have now!

20:54.770 --> 20:57.030
My freedom is up there!

20:57.570 --> 20:59.170
No one is going to get in my way anymore!

21:00.050 --> 21:02.040
My future is...

21:09.580 --> 21:10.290
Now!

21:10.460 --> 21:12.280
Kneel before me!

21:26.880 --> 21:27.500
Huh?

21:30.210 --> 21:30.910
P-Pochi?!

21:35.710 --> 21:36.730
Stop it!

21:36.730 --> 21:37.860
Hey!

21:38.450 --> 21:39.920
Stop it, Pochi!

21:40.360 --> 21:41.400
No-No!

21:41.820 --> 21:43.820
S-Stop it!

21:43.990 --> 21:46.390
Hey, Pochi!

21:48.840 --> 21:50.200
That's enough!

21:50.450 --> 21:53.210
NOT YOU TOO!

